      "writtenOn": "2014-03-21T15:15:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The situation is that after the user/group is deleted the other actions are looking for it in the DB and are all failing since is not there anymore. I tried to keep the reference before delete the user so any observer of that event can execute code based on the deleted user. In the previous approach these actions were executed by the drivers before the deletion",
